[{"title":"张瑕瑀为予写扶桑一幅因题其上 其一","author":"胡承珙","text":"水国春阴护板扉，仙葩合与饲蚕肥。\n茧成如瓮丝如血，不数猩红覆地衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2897,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张瑕瑀为予写扶桑一幅因题其上 其二","author":"胡承珙","text":"牡丹祗许和酥黏，金凤惟能蘸甲尖。\n别有风流传荔谱，赤浆盈椀渍红盐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2898,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张瑕瑀为予写扶桑一幅因题其上 其三","author":"胡承珙","text":"千丈蟠根碧海东，全胜百日半年红。\n何因却植通明殿，照彻丹霞影正中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2899,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张瑕瑀为予写扶桑一幅因题其上 其四","author":"胡承珙","text":"故人几许费燕支，一幅鹅溪写折枝。\n我亦枯肠苦搜索，为君拈句比红儿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2900,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"早起至船厂督挽战舰交营","author":"胡承珙","text":"紞鼓连声接曙钟，西郊未别且从容。\n溪流夜涨潮痕在，沙路朝晴草色浓。\n归兴鼋鼍殊可驾，旷怀魑魅惯相逢。\n饱看藏壑频遭徙，一笑虚舟任所冲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2901,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惜字歌","author":"胡承珙","text":"吾侪足傲虞姬婿，识字非徒姓名记。\n伟哉仓圣万古功，一丁差胜两石弓。\n粪土何人恣狠籍，元经覆瓿不知惜。\n世人但詈秦始皇，焚馀犹胜为帣囊。\n何怪荒郊鬼夜哭，不如饱死蠹鱼腹。\n陈生海外守一毡，抱此区区殊可怜。\n斯冰骨朽数千载，掩骼埋胔赖生在。\n更怜近代多好奇，细书布满著色磁。\n一朝失手甑堕地，泥中恍惚成窑字。\n陈生见之辄攘臂，大石粗沙竞磨厉。\n此意堪为学子师，拜经瘗笔徒尔为。\n嗤他诗礼称儒者，袖有金椎祗控颐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2902,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"积雨遣闷","author":"胡承珙","text":"海天风雨欲平沉，六月阴凉袭葛襟。\n湿气朝看黄耳菌，老怀閒羡白头禽。\n空阶久任无心滴，野草偏如有意侵。\n不是维摩频隐几，聊将震撼试潮音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2903,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁来红","author":"胡承珙","text":"三年长剑倚天东，手种扶桑映日红。\n数遍园中閒草木，独将心事托飞鸿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2904,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冈山道中","author":"胡承珙","text":"木杪行人度，篱根稚子嬉。\n草荒眠鹿疃，风堕挂猿枝。\n白屋贫如许，青山自不知。\n林端鸣络纬，能得几絇丝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2905,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"盐水港","author":"胡承珙","text":"十月晓寒轻，搴帷问去程。\n野花檐外朵，蛮鸟树头声。\n斥地时防晒，沙田近废耕。\n眼看流寓夥，何计活苍生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2906,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"斗六门至沙连堡","author":"胡承珙","text":"天将奇险界诸蛮，十八重溪湾复湾。\n负弩屯丁头片羽，裹盐峒女耳重镮。\n漩涡中有石弹子，老树根多木假山。\n且说桃源堪避世，白波青嶂讵人间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2907,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"淡水道中","author":"胡承珙","text":"荦确疲行役，肩舆得暂眠。\n邮程榕记里，番俗黍为年。\n鲎柱通沟尾，蚝山出屋颠。\n乡心托飞鸟，已在夕阳边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2908,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹堑","author":"胡承珙","text":"地辟洪荒近，天围渤澥宽。\n海云生处白，山雨晚来寒。\n但足鱼羹饭，何须鲎壳冠。\n时清息烽火，有竹报平安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2909,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭女随珠 其一","author":"胡承珙","text":"讵有门楣待尔强，祗怜娇小似平阳。\n银鱼昔每从爷觅，金鹿今闻比母长。\n幼却膻腥应夙慧，贫疏罗绮尚新妆。\n谁知未嫁先黄土，裙布无缘愧戴良。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2910,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭女随珠 其二","author":"胡承珙","text":"十年京国洗铅华，千里关山未见家。\n官閤牵衣成死别，镜台留照剩空花。\n杜鹃屡滴思亲泪，精卫难回汎海槎。\n一种天涯匏系感，层峰何处哭韩拿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2911,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立冬日张瑕瑀馈黄菊花","author":"胡承珙","text":"三年海外愁风雨，九日尊前感岁华。\n病客朝来添白发，故人秋杪送黄花。\n炎方本不因人热，正色才能辟物邪。\n漫说小阳桃李艳，几番用落见天涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2912,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"以吴门药酒一罂饷张瑕瑀","author":"胡承珙","text":"虚从海客话瀛州，药物蛮方未易求。\n多病敢誇医国手，无功合拜醉乡侯。\n尝新紫蟹来何莫，耐久黄花尚似秋。\n安得凤凰台下路，为君千丈筑糟邱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2913,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日郡郊述怀 其一","author":"胡承珙","text":"炎徼时无准，经冬未作寒。\n白云蒸海热，碧树裹烟团。\n晓市鱼虾贱，丰塍乌雀欢。\n郊西逢猎骑，为觅鹿皮冠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2914,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日郡郊述怀 其二","author":"胡承珙","text":"岁事从人问，官声转自疑。\n贫缘安命早，病学养生迟。\n对客常求药，归装只辨诗。\n犹馀几两屐，未了一生痴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2915,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"因病得告","author":"胡承珙","text":"刷鬓微星已自怜，更何心事觊华颠。\n清时多病终无用，绝域能还亦偶然。\n半顷荒田春雨后，三间老屋夕阳边。\n一閒偿尽平生愿，敢为莼鲈效昔贤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2916,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"胡承珙","text":"閒愁不逐酒杯空，赢得衰颜暂借红。\n花事尚如三月好，灯光又与一年终。\n海山兜率商归处，香案觚棱忆梦中。\n为问青春谁是伴，片帆吾已约春风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2917,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甲申1824元旦试笔","author":"胡承珙","text":"怪道参军语带蛮，三年鱼鸟笑人顽。\n将随鸥下无机地，已在鸦飞不到山。\n更鼓叠催乡梦短，簿书刚了宦情闲。\n紫宸青琐高寒处，回首风尘愧鬓斑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2918,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"得告后闲居候代小窗展卷终日萧然率成一律","author":"胡承珙","text":"药炉茶灶小徘徊，依旧埋头故纸堆。\n门不谁何无客到，笔非画诺已神来。\n真看海上生明月，莫向风前奏落梅。\n为问宏农作啸客，不妨尊俎定常开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2919,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"留别张瑕瑀 其一","author":"胡承珙","text":"群儿拍手趁山公，老葛并州气独雄。\n酩酊乾坤才一马，笑谈辟易已千熊。\n我行惯值盆翻雨，君去须乘舶趠风。\n下视蜉蝣何所恋，愿随云将问鸿蒙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2920,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"留别张瑕瑀 其二","author":"胡承珙","text":"读画敲诗且未休，玉山犹恨不同游。\n三年作客千场醉，万绪萦身一夕抽。\n各有青毡为故物，相期白首亦风流。\n芽姜箭菜江南味，领取归时满意秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2921,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"午日","author":"胡承珙","text":"竞渡空佳节，生还尚异乡。\n蛟龙虽未得，蒲柳总堪伤。\n懒学灵均问，閒寻抱朴方。\n赪桐好颜色，回首惜年芳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2922,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长尾三娘","author":"六十七","text":"翠羽光华绶带长，如云委地美人妆。\n命名当日非无意，谓胜黄家第四娘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2923,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"倒挂鸟","author":"六十七","text":"美质天然著绿衣，来从吕宋见应稀。\n啄馀丹嘴慵无语，锁向金笼困不飞。\n中立羞随凡鸟列，倒垂却与众生违。\n细推物理诚难解，欲起张华问化机。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2924,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鮡鱼","author":"六十七","text":"无鳞隐见绿苔斑，额上双眸月两环。\n掉尾居然行地上，潜身不肯入波间。\n烹来羹脍争誇美，捕向淤泥未觉艰。\n海外虫鱼皆有异，他年归去纪南蛮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2925,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金丝蝴蝶","author":"王洪","text":"不识波罗国，争看蛱蝶花。\n吐丝多浥露，展翅各矜华。\n最喜秋阳映，应须锦幔遮。\n风飘仙客醉，窗外影横斜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2926,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"羞草 其三","author":"孙元衡","text":"萱花自惜可忘忧，小草如何却解愁。\n为语世人休怪诧，风情太甚要含羞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2927,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"魁斗山","author":"张湄","text":"近接宫墙数仞高，星光磊磊起文豪。\n问名已列魁三象，分派应如海一鳌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2928,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蒙面","author":"张湄","text":"香车碧怀厌纷纭，拥盖微行拟鄂君。\n一队新妆相掩映，红□叶底避斜曛。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2929,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"骑犊","author":"张湄","text":"金勒笼头锦辔纡，追风犊子抵神驹。\n晴郊鞭影摇山绿，写出函关老子图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2930,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"衣服","author":"张湄","text":"凤头龙尾好衣裾，锦绣偏诸谢不如。\n若使贾生来此地，未知流涕更何如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2931,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"禾间","author":"张湄","text":"流珠炊玉食维艰，终岁勤劬敢务閒。\n生计只知依稼穑，一枝栖息号禾间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2932,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"番俗 其一","author":"张湄","text":"包练衣衫最丽都，换年风景野花敷。\n金藤耀首新妆裹，答答偏宜宾也珠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2933,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"番俗 其二","author":"张湄","text":"竞誇麻达好腰围，健足凌空捷似飞。\n萨鼓铿锵声近远，轻尘一道走差归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2934,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"番俗 其四","author":"张湄","text":"鹅筒惯写红夷字，鴃舌能通先圣书。\n何物儿童真拔俗，琅琅音韵诵关雎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2935,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"番俗 其六","author":"张湄","text":"傀儡山深恶木稠，穿林如虎攫人头。\n群凶社里谁雄长，茅宇新添金髑髅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2936,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"衣服","author":"张湄","text":"乌衣渐易裸人风，尺布为裈犊鼻同。\n可但鹿胎花簇簇，达戈纹锦手裁工。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2937,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"穿耳","author":"张湄","text":"垂肩粉耳大如盘，贯竹填螺取次宽。\nㄚ角髻边风不定，翩翲五色斗鸡翰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2938,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"牵手","author":"张湄","text":"定情虽假白螺钱，麻达歌谐礼数捐。\n几处社寮清月夜，鼻箫吹彻手随牵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2939,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赘婿","author":"张湄","text":"瓜瓞移根自剪劖，家家秦赘俗同谙。\n再传尽使孙忘祖，有赚惟知女胜男。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2940,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"布床","author":"张湄","text":"一枕鼾齁树杪眠，从来木处不曾颠。\n此中风味人知少，蝴蝶南柯梦竟全。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2941,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浴儿","author":"张湄","text":"浴川女伴不知寒，绿水鸬鹚雪影翻。\n见说生雏才堕地，波池堪作浴儿盘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2942,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"放手","author":"张湄","text":"反目还将放手称，牵手挈酒痛交惩。\n何如白首期偕老，高筏迎归耀彩缯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2943,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"捕鹿","author":"张湄","text":"出草东郊径路深，枝头鸟语最关心。\n几声啁唽宛如诉，不似黄鹂俱好音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2944,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"捕鱼","author":"张湄","text":"抵须设网与操舟，撑突清溪截上流。\n发发游鱼齐入手，筠笼顷刻百千头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2945,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡水","author":"张湄","text":"攀枝已讶众猱升，渡水惊牵百丈藤。\n真见飞行都绝迹，西京那数戏橦縆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2946,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赏番","author":"张湄","text":"领悬文石间雕螺，连臂唉噫踏地歌。\n簇锦围中看赐酒，累觞未觉醉颜酡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2947,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黄梨","author":"张湄","text":"毛羽丰茸皮甲皴，阿谁截得凤凰身。\n番梨纵得称名好，何似中原大谷珍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2948,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"刺竹","author":"张湄","text":"干霄刺竹易聚生，渭水淇园未较盈。\n千亩侯封未足贵，赖君海表立长城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2949,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"漫记 其一","author":"黄叔璥","text":"沙辘行来界北边，裸人虽陋意殊虔。\n官厨未识都都味，首顶糍盘众妇先。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2950,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"织布","author":"董天工","text":"斲木为机似月圆，横穿翠筱夹丝缠。\n掺掺巧织戈纹锦，斑驳争绔柿蒂鲜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2951,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"口琴","author":"董天工","text":"宛如私语夜深深，别样丝桐别样音。\n齿颊低微音韵渺，雄鸣雌和月轻阴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2952,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"布床","author":"董天工","text":"何事番儿不畏寒，布床高挂桠枝端。\n风吹木叶声萧瑟，好似婴孩熟睡残。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2953,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"走差","author":"董天工","text":"状似捲荷四寸长，手环相击响丁当。\n不疾不徐音铿尔，远韵清微胜鼓簧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2954,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台卉四绝 其一","author":"董天工","text":"飘然玉质森森秀，别有幽香到小庭。\n不用娇容教傅粉，逢君一见自娉婷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2955,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台卉四绝 其二","author":"董天工","text":"素华真可胜梅妆，点点琼葩点点芳。\n翠叶缤纷怀洁白，浓香暗惹绿衣郎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2956,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台卉四绝 其三","author":"董天工","text":"蕴抱冰心此一方，不教蜂蝶逐花狂。\n琼姿本是神仙骨，肯作人间贾女香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2957,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台卉四绝 其四","author":"董天工","text":"香闻七里玉玲珑，月色平林和露瀜。\n玉女原来看玉树，一般清白煦春风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2958,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仙丹","author":"董天工","text":"一朵烿云物外仙，丹珠累累映霞鲜。\n漫言黄母鬓花落，移种东山处处妍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2959,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梅 其一","author":"熊学鹏","text":"一枝谁自江南寄，岛屿冲寒亦有香。\n绘出当年东阁兴，高吟不必忆何郎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2960,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梅 其二","author":"熊学鹏","text":"调鼎和羹异日才，边城春色喜先开。\n会看百卉从今盛，锦绣层层遍九垓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2961,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"诸罗北香湖见柳","author":"方世泰","text":"依旧长条踠地垂，行人系马自生悲。\n可怜已是将枯日，还向邮亭管别离。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2962,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"诸罗署中夜坐占示义儿","author":"方世泰","text":"轻云如縠掩残晖，向晚凉风动葛衣。\n木叶渐凋霜未降，社钱才敛燕初归。\n苦空禅早闻三昧，隐见星休问少微。\n客里无书成寂寞，流萤底事破窗飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2963,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"镇安街有陋祠祀女神不名或曰赵姑也诗以志之","author":"方世泰","text":"飒飒天风吹古祠，溪烟不动柳成丝。\n一春微雨香灯暗，尽日无言宝帐垂。\n独鸟远飞芳草外，孤花刚谢夕阳时。\n精灵似尔复何恨，翠黛含颦尚怨谁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2964,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"家书","author":"方世泰","text":"月子弯弯照铁衣，辕门吹角早霜飞。\n可怜隔岁家书到，只问存亡不问归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2965,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西州恸 其一","author":"方祖荫","text":"西州铭一恸，乃兄哭舅词。\n谁知哭舅处，翻见哭兄时。\n宦海恶风波，况复遭乱离。\n功名殉五斗，身世弃涂泥。\n高岗步猛虎，洪波拔蛟螭。\n由来瘴疠地，险恶盗所资。\n当时覆大军，登城捲黄旗。\n人鬼号失声，呼天天罔知。\n谁当临难日，为收绝命词。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2966,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西州恸 其二","author":"方祖荫","text":"吾舅被祸时，兄犹归舅骨。\n吾兄更惨伤，遗骸荒草没。\n碧血化青燐，千人共一窟。\n阵云蔽日光，荧惑蚀圆月。\n草木失芳菲，阴崖阗霜雪。\n夜夜啸孤魂，关山悲难越。\n生前骨肉恩，出门使永诀。\n岂无梦魂来，一为江上别。\n惟应九泉下，甥舅同呜咽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2967,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"对月","author":"方祖荫","text":"又见盈盈月，閒窗夜有辉。\n四时常伴客，何日与同归。\n天末风初起，林间露共霏。\n故园离别久，那免叹无衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":2968,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]